"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">New repository</span> select karo.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">Step 2 — Repository details fill karo</h2><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Form mein ye details enter karna:</p><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><label class="TextBase-qM5iDq Label-XPFIPv" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="label" data-d-size="sm" data-d-weight="medium" id="_r_1o1_">Repository name</label><div class="Container-PpxXyQ" data-w-component="" data-variant="outline" data-size="xl" data-focused="false" data-pill=""><input aria-labelledby="_r_1o1_" data-d-component="input" id="_r_1o2_" class="Input-S5bfLR" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore="true" type="text" value="aws-vpc-networking-project"></div></div><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><label class="TextBase-qM5iDq Label-XPFIPv" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="label" data-d-size="sm" data-d-weight="medium" id="_r_1o4_">Description</label><div class="Container-W7NjQD" data-w-component="" data-variant="outline" data-size="xl" data-focused="false" style="--textarea-min-rows: 3; --textarea-max-rows: 3;"><textarea aria-labelledby="_r_1o4_" data-d-component="textarea" id="_r_1o5_" class="Textarea-Q0w3LU" rows="3" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore="true">Beginner AWS project demonstrating VPC networking, public and private subnets, route tables, and Internet Gateway configuration.</textarea></div></div><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);"><label class="TextBase-qM5iDq Label-XPFIPv" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="label" data-d-size="sm" data-d-weight="medium">Visibility</label><div role="radiogroup" aria-required="false" class="RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-sFHFZn" data-direction="col" aria-label="Options" data-d-component="radio-group" tabindex="0" style="outline: none;"><div class="flex" data-d-component="radio"><label for="Public-_r_1o8_" class="RadioLabel-aEyICO"><div class="RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="Public" id="Public-_r_1o8_" class="RadioItem-eqbQKh" tabindex="-1" data-radix-collection-item=""><span data-state="checked" class="RadioIndicator-QSL7RM"></span></button></div>Public — recruiters can view it</label></div><div class="flex" data-d-component="radio"><label for="Private-_r_1oa_" class="RadioLabel-aEyICO"><div class="RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-state="unchecked" value="Private" id="Private-_r_1oa_" class="RadioItem-eqbQKh" tabindex="-1" data-radix-collection-item=""></button></div>Private — only you and authorized people</label></div></div></div><div data-has-label="" data-orientation="left" class="Round-oTBDZ6 Container-tuMRJ8"><button type="button" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="on" class="Checkbox-HGrYIk" id="_r_1oc_" data-d-component="checkbox"><span data-state="checked" class="CheckMark-kWHPnc" style="pointer-events: none;"></span></button><label for="_r_1oc_" class="Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-ymBfGz"><span>Add a README file</span></label></div><button type="button" class="Button-MckCnJ Button-Ng7lPh" data-color="primary" data-variant="solid" data-pill="" data-size="lg" data-block="" data-d-component="button" data-d-block=""><span class="ButtonInner-okLAMd"> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="InlineIcon-LhowAj" data-d-component="icon" data-d-inline="" style="width: 14px; height: 14px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: calc(0.5cap - 7px);"><path d="M12.7587 2H16.2413C17.0463 1.99999 17.7106 1.99998 18.2518 2.04419C18.8139 2.09012 19.3306 2.18868 19.816 2.43597C20.5686 2.81947 21.1805 3.43139 21.564 4.18404C21.8113 4.66937 21.9099 5.18608 21.9558 5.74817C22 6.28936 22 6.95372 22 7.75868V11.2413C22 12.0463 22 12.7106 21.9558 13.2518C21.9099 13.8139 21.8113 14.3306 21.564 14.816C21.1805 15.5686 20.5686 16.1805 19.816 16.564C19.3306 16.8113 18.8139 16.9099 18.2518 16.9558C17.8906 16.9853 17.4745 16.9951 16.9984 16.9984C16.9951 17.4745 16.9853 17.8906 16.9558 18.2518C16.9099 18.8139 16.8113 19.3306 16.564 19.816C16.1805 20.5686 15.5686 21.1805 14.816 21.564C14.3306 21.8113 13.8139 21.9099 13.2518 21.9558C12.7106 22 12.0463 22 11.2413 22H7.75868C6.95372 22 6.28936 22 5.74818 21.9558C5.18608 21.9099 4.66937 21.8113 4.18404 21.564C3.43139 21.1805 2.81947 20.5686 2.43597 19.816C2.18868 19.3306 2.09012 18.8139 2.04419 18.2518C1.99998 17.7106 1.99999 17.0463 2 16.2413V12.7587C1.99999 11.9537 1.99998 11.2894 2.04419 10.7482C2.09012 10.1861 2.18868 9.66937 2.43597 9.18404C2.81947 8.43139 3.43139 7.81947 4.18404 7.43598C4.66937 7.18868 5.18608 7.09012 5.74817 7.04419C6.10939 7.01468 6.52548 7.00487 7.00162 7.00162C7.00487 6.52548 7.01468 6.10939 7.04419 5.74817C7.09012 5.18608 7.18868 4.66937 7.43598 4.18404C7.81947 3.43139 8.43139 2.81947 9.18404 2.43597C9.66937 2.18868 10.1861 2.09012 10.7482 2.04419C11.2894 1.