omponent="text">Neeche <code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code">.gitignore</code> aur license ke options bhi honge. Filhaal dono <span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">No .gitignore</span> aur <span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">No license</span> rehne do.</p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Phir <span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Create repository</span> click karo.</p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Important:</span> AWS account number, access keys, credentials ya screenshots mein sensitive information upload mat karna.</p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Jab repository create ho jaye, mujhe screenshot ya repository page par jo options dikh rahe hain woh bhej dena. Phir hum README mein project ki details add karenge.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-