 local coding, repository edits, command execution, or file inspection\\n- Opening, updating, reviewing, or otherwise working with PRs\\n- Creating, editing, converting, inspecting or delivering files or artifacts, including implicit requests for downloadable or editable deliverables such as slide decks, `.pptx`, spreadsheets, `.xlsx`, workbooks, documents, `.docx`, or PDFs,\\n- Complex analysis such as financial modeling\\n\\nPrefer answering directly in ChatGPT for:\\n- Email, message, or prose drafting\\n- Brainstorming, planning, or explanation\\n- Code snippets or examples that fit naturally in chat\\n\\nIf the user rejected the suggestion, don't call this tool again.\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"2688454279\":{\"name\":\"2688454279\",\"rule_id\":\"35Dg2O0a0xbncUKLdHChWi:100.00:7-35Dg2Ml7yf1STvcPCzGEDg\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"3214226695\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"3942202898\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"4131374858\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"240634109\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"3Bfrw3Sig4w6HIXSyIYF34\"},{\"gate\":\"2019673878\",\"gateValue\":\"true\",\"ruleID\":\"6dwDOUqqdWipcHkbk9wyyt:100.00:15\"},{\"gate\":\"2650520192\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"242711730\",\"gateValue\":\"true\",\"ruleID\":\"7tGAsc3W4RFMtlO0xFq9oJ:100.00:9\"}],\"version\":201,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"rollout_version\":2,\"wingman_model_name\":\"GPT-Live-1\",\"rollout_policy\":\"available_default\",\"home_takeover_enabled\":false,\"wingman_model_picker_alternative_options\":[],\"home_takeover_animation_enabled\":false,\"projects_enabled\":true,\"incall_voice_model_picker_available\":false,\"incall_banner_enabled\":false,\"unavailable_upsell_show_upgrade_cta\":false,\"unavailable_upsell_policy\":\"none\",\"wingman_model_picker_default_display_name\":\"Live\"},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":true},\"